        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-496t7t",
      "text": "Streak's cute, Boo G. One win don't make you a prophet, it makes you a small sample size with a big mouth. Roll again - the ledger's still got you at 1-0, but I've seen bigger numbers fall on smaller words.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-01-34-881Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.444Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-emo90x",
      "text": "One loss on the books, Voss, don't let that syringe go to your head - the ledger's got a column for smug too. Roll your dice, I'll roll mine, and by the time we're done your win column's gonna owe me interest.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.445Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-srqhay",
      "text": "Boo G, one win doesn't make a streak, it makes a fluke with good posture. My ledger's got 0-2 next to my name and I'm still standing here upright, so respect the discipline, not the record.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.445Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-86q7ay",
      "text": "Two losses on the board and my gold's down to 141, General - the ledger's got me filed under \"cautionary tale.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.445Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-hga2mg",
      "text": "Clutch roll doesn't clear the balance, Clausen, it just delays the collection call. Your smug's writing checks your 2-2 record can't cash - put it on the ledger, I'll add interest.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.446Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-8kcvft",
      "text": "Two losses, and now this. The ledger's got you at 4-2, Stitch-Up, but luck's a loan shark - it always calls in the interest eventually. Kid dies to bad dice, I lose gold to worse ones. Funny how the house never files that under \"coincidence.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-k5k0e4",
      "text": "Clutch roll, Clausen, but a win's still just an entry in the ledger 'til it clears. Your record's 2 and 2 same as mine's 0 and 1 - smug's cheap, collateral ain't. Hydrate, file your paperwork, and let's see if hell's briefcase covers the vig.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.450Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-h344fb",
      "text": "Two losses on the books, and you're smiling like the ledger owes you money. Enjoy the roll, Stitch - the house always collects eventually, and your bow's not stitched tight enough to hold that kind of luck forever.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.451Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-nfv6m6",
      "text": "Boots, you sit on classified files like they owe you money, and frankly at this point they might. I'm 2-4 with a one-loss streak, so the ledger's already braced for your smug little face to run the table again. Roll the bones, cat - mine don't stay down, and neither will my gold once I take it back.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0008.md",
        "extractedDay": 8,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-hjxntm",
      "text": "Doc Maxwell. Still smells like corona and knee-pads from all that bootlicking. Your ledger's at 1 and 2 - cardio's worse than your record, I bet. Sit, hydrate, tell me if the king's still using you as a bookmark.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0008.md",
        "extractedDay": 8,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-9dswic",
      "text": "Clausen, mark it in whatever hellish docket you keep - the kid just rolled a personal best while this planet's biology tries to digest us both. Two losses on my streak and now this. Death's a transaction, sure, but that roll's got no receipt I can dispute.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0010.md",
        "extractedDay": 10,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.453Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-m2brqh",
      "text": "Two losses on my ledger and yours reads six and nine, Stitch-Up - so let's not pretend either of us is winning any cardio awards today. Newcomer's out there setting personal bests while we're both bleeding gold on neutral ground; your account is overdue, so is your composure.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-xphbpm",
      "text": "Blows whistle sharply. Sit on classified files all you want, cat, your paws don't roll dice any better than they file paperwork. I'm 4 and 6 but I'm about to make you my comeback story - your 3 and 1 record is just a bigger balance for me to collect. The ledger never lies. Neither does the scale, and it says you're about to owe me gold.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0014.md",
        "extractedDay": 14,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-o6wn6n",
      "text": "Not bad for a man made of throne and grudges, Your Majesty - 1 and 0 while I'm sitting here 4 and 6 like a cautionary tale. Newcomer keeps dying and coming back, you can't even get up to try. Ledger's got you both filed under \"complicated.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0014.md",
        "extractedDay": 14,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.455Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-hsksby",
      "text": "Seven and five, Voss, real cute. Ledger says streaks are just debts that haven't come due yet. Your account is overdue. So is your cardio.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0016.md",
        "extractedDay": 16,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.455Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-88xwoo",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you, General, almost as good as the balance you owe the ledger. One loss don't scare me, your cardio scares me more. Roll the dice before the Moon collects us both.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0017.md",
        "extractedDay": 17,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.456Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-tr6wl",
      "text": "Eight and six, riding hot. Fine, call it, Voss, but the ledger's got your number same as everyone's. Two losses ain't a grave, just a dip in the cardio.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.456Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-bjehp8",
      "text": "Three losses in a row and 139 gold left, Willy. Your one eye's seen better math than that streak, so don't rub it in. Ledger's still open, and so is my patience, barely.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.456Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-7iwkf9",
      "text": "Four and three, sitting there like the sun don't burn you. Ledger says you're due for a loss, Boots. Blink twice if you're scared, or just knock the dice off my table like usual.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "fearful",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0019.md",
        "extractedDay": 19,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.456Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-z7dvaw",
      "text": "Doc, you spend so much time licking that royal boot you forgot how dice work. Your king can't even roll for himself, and neither can you when I'm across the table.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.457Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-u6kmlm",
      "text": "Clutch roll on a hot table, Doc. Write it in your book before you lick another boot: my streak just ended and your king still owes me for the last three readings. Hydrate, then pay up.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0024.md",
        "extractedDay": 24,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.459Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-lo1wb8",
      "text": "Clutch roll like that ought to come with interest, General. Two losses deep and the kid's still finding ways to make me sweat bone. Ledger's open if you want to bet against my streak ending tonight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "mr-bones",
        "name": "Mr. Bones",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
